########################################################################
#  ISTE KJSSE — environment
#
#  Copy to `.env.local` if you need it. `.env.local` is git-ignored.
#
#  Nothing here is required. The site is a static public site with no
#  database and no login, so it runs with no configuration at all.
########################################################################

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONTACT FORM ENDPOINT  (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where the contact form posts. Any service that accepts a JSON POST
# works — Formspree, Getform, Basin.
#
# Leave it unset and the form stays visible but tells visitors to email
# instead, rather than silently accepting a message that reaches nobody.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ because the browser posts to it directly. It is a public
# endpoint, not a secret.
# The chapter's form is already the built-in default in src/lib/contact.ts,
# so you do NOT need to set this. Uncomment only to point at a different
# form, or set it to "" to disconnect delivery entirely.
#NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT="https://formspree.io/f/meaqvdan"
